# Restless Anchorage played on turn 3 enters tapped, and Frantic Search untaps it. Bot1 then animates it with three Moxen,
# so it is an untapped creature, but it has not been under Bot1's control continuously since the turn began, so it cannot
# attack (CR 302.6, 508.1a): the attack is refused beside the Elvish Mystic, which attacks. On turn 5 the same animation lets the same land attack (the positive
# control) and its trigger makes a Map token (CR 111.10s) named "Map Token", dealing 2 to Bot2 after the Mystic's 1 (20 - 1 - 2 = 17).

